# Paper-to-Brief

Deep research agent built with LangChain `deepagents` (LangGraph underneath). Pydantic AI will be added in Phase 2 for validated structured outputs; do not add it yet.

## Layout
- `src/brief/tools.py` — web_search, fetch_page
- `src/brief/prompts.py` — main, researcher, critic prompts
- `src/brief/agent.py` — create_deep_agent wiring (todos, filesystem, subagents)
- `src/brief/baseline.py` — plain agent with no deep-agent features, for comparison
- `run.py` — CLI entry point
- `evals/questions.txt` — fixed eval questions, same for every milestone
- `runs/<run_id>/` — per-run agent files (question.md, notes/, draft/, review.md, final/, stats.json); git-ignored

## Conventions
- Use `uv` for dependencies. Python 3.11+.
- Prefer `create_deep_agent` over hand-built LangChain agents.
- Every claim in a brief needs a source URL.
- Keep structured-output steps as separate functions so Pydantic AI can replace them later.
